g kappa from 2^-182 to 2^-59.335","reuse":"link","source_seed":"C_community_seed.curated.json","statements":[],"summary":"Computer-assisted manuscript with exact verifiers improving OpenAI's integer multiplication exponent from 2^-182 to 2^-59.335, an early checkpoint in the family 109 race.","traction":"not measured","url":"https://github.com/erayyap/integer-multiplication-kappa"},{"authors":[{"handle":"@SJ_Swapnil_Jain","name":"Swapnil Jain","url":"https://x.com/SJ_Swapnil_Jain"}],"date":"2026-10-08","families":["109"],"id":"swapnil-jain-integer-mult-kappa","kind":"follow-up","licence":"apache-2.0","name":"Swapnil-jain/integer-mult-kappa","reuse":"link","source_seed":"B_community_seed.json","statements":[],"summary":"A parallel series of eleven numbered conditional bounds for integer multiplication that builds on the community repository and adds Lean-checked finite certificates, written with Claude.","traction":"25 stars, 4 forks on 2026-10-11 (GitHub, read by the projects desk); eleven X posts totalling about 988,000 views, the third with 1,411 likes (X embed API and a mirror, read by the desk)","url":"https://github.com/Swapnil-jain/integer-mult-kappa"},{"authors":[{"handle":"","name":"Prove2Me","url":""}],"date":"2026-10-11","families":["109"],"id":"formal-campaign-integer-multiplication-below-n-log--11c10","kind":"follow-up","licence":"n/a","name":"Campaign: Integer Multiplication Below n log n","reuse":"link","source_seed":"C_community_seed.curated.json","statements":[],"summary":"Campaign turning improved exponents for integer multiplication into complete Lean proofs, building on Harvey and van der Hoeven, the release's family 109 manuscript (which claims kappa = 2^-182) and later community constructions.","traction":"not measured","url":"https://prove2.me/campaigns/integer-multiplication-kappa"},{"authors":[{"name":"Prove2Me"}],"date":"2026-10-11","families":["109","107"],"id":"formal-prove2me-open-platform-for-machine-checked-m-2ae32","kind":"institution"